OL,3,GNEWSAStab victim named as man charged
OL,4,Awith murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who died with stab wounds in a
OL,7,Ftown high street has been named as
OL,8,FTiago Ferreira.
OL,10,FThe 23-year-old died after being found
OL,11,Funconscious on Stonehouse High Street
OL,12,Fat about 23:15 GMT on Sunday,
OL,13,FGloucestershire Police said.
OL,15,FIn a tribute released earlier, his
OL,16,Ffamily said Ferreira had left behind an
OL,17,F"immeasurable amount of love, beautiful
OL,18,Fmemories, and an immense emptiness in
OL,19,Four hearts".
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
