OL,3,GNEWSAStab victim named as man charged
OL,4,Awith murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FDaryl John Ackland, of Park Road in
OL,7,FStonehouse, has been charged with
OL,8,FFerreira's murder and is due to appear
OL,9,Fat Cheltenham Magistrates' Court later.
